  "steps": [
    "Heat the mustard oil until it just smokes, then cool slightly and add the hing, bay leaf, cloves, cinnamon and both cardamoms.",
    "Add the mutton and sear on high heat for 8 minutes until browned.",
    "Mix the chilli powder with a little water and stir it in along with the whisked curd, a spoon at a time, cooking until the oil separates.",
    "Add the dry ginger, ground fennel and salt and cook 5 minutes.",
    "Add the water, bring to a boil, cover and simmer on low heat for 50 to 60 minutes until the mutton is falling tender.",
    "Rest 10 minutes and serve with steamed rice or naan."
  ]
